<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم البوت</title>
  <meta name="description" content="FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم متقدمة لإدارة بوت FX9 على ديسكورد">
  <meta property="og:title" content="FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم البوت" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم متقدمة لإدارة بوت FX9 على ديسكورد. إدارة السيرفرات، نظام تذاكر، قنوات صوتية مؤقتة، والمزيد." />
  <meta property="og:image" content="https://fx9-dashboard.onrender.com/og-image.svg" />
  <meta property="og:url" content="https://fx9-dashboard.onrender.com" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="FX9 Dashboard" />
  <meta property="og:locale" content="ar_AR" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0ea5e9" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم البوت" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم متقدمة لإدارة بوت FX9 على ديسكورد." />
  <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://fx9-dashboard.onrender.com/og-image.svg" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <style>
:root {
  --pg-primary: #0ea5e9;
  --pg-secondary: #14b8a6;
  --pg-accent: #8b5cf6;
  --pg-dark: #020617;
  --pg-card: #0f172a;
  --pg-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  --pg-text: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
  --pg-muted: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
  --pg-font: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
}

* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
body { font-family:var(--pg-font); background:var(--pg-dark); color:var(--pg-text); overflow-x:hidden; }
a { text-decoration:none; color:inherit; }

.pg-nav {
  position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:1000;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  padding:0 28px; height:68px;
  background:rgba(2,6,23,0.7); backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(1.5);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(1.5);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--pg-border);
}
.pg-brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; font-size:1.1rem; font-weight:800; color:white; letter-spacing:0.5px; }
.pg-brand-icon {
  width:32px; height:32px; border-radius:8px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg-primary),var(--pg-accent));
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:0.85rem; color:white;
  box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(14,165,233,0.3);
}
.pg-nav-btn {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  padding:9px 22px; border-radius:10px; font-family:var(--pg-font);
  font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.25s; border:none;
}
.pg-nav-btn-primary {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg-primary),var(--pg-secondary));
  color:white; box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(14,165,233,0.3);
}
.pg-nav-btn-primary:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(14,165,233,0.45); }
.pg-nav-btn-ghost {
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
  border:1px solid var(--pg-border);
}
.pg-nav-btn-ghost:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.08); color:white; }
.pg-nav-btn-danger {
  background:rgba(237,66,69,0.12); color:#f87171; border:1px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.15);
}
.pg-nav-btn-danger:hover { background:rgba(237,66,69,0.2); }

.pg-hero {
  position:relative; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #020617 0%, #0c1222 40%, #0f172a 70%, #020617 100%);
  overflow:hidden;
}
.pg-hero-bg {
  position:absolute; inset:0; overflow:hidden;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 0%, rgba(14,165,233,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 50% at 80% 80%, rgba(139,92,246,0.06) 0%, transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 20% 60%, rgba(20,184,166,0.04) 0%, transparent 50%);
}
.pg-dots {
  position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:0.3;
  background-image:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 1px, transparent 1px);
  background-size:32px 32px;
}
.pg-hero-shape {
  position:absolute; border-radius:50%; filter:blur(100px);
  animation: pgOrbit 20s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.pg-hs1 { width:500px; height:500px; background:var(--pg-primary); top:-200px; right:-100px; opacity:0.07; }
.pg-hs2 { width:350px; height:350px; background:var(--pg-accent); bottom:-100px; left:-80px; opacity:0.06; animation-delay:-7s; }
.pg-hs3 { width:200px; height:200px; background:var(--pg-secondary); top:60%; left:50%; opacity:0.04; animation-delay:-14s; }
@keyframes pgOrbit {
  0%,100% { transform:translate(0,0) scale(1); }
  25% { transform:translate(40px,-30px) scale(1.05); }
  50% { transform:translate(-20px,30px) scale(0.95); }
  75% { transform:translate(-40px,-20px) scale(1.02); }
}
.pg-hero-content {
  position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; padding:120px 28px 80px;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;
}
@media (max-width:900px) { .pg-hero-content { grid-template-columns:1fr; text-align:center; gap:40px; } }
.pg-hero-text h1 {
  font-size:3rem; font-weight:800; line-height:1.25; margin-bottom:16px;
}
.pg-hero-text h1 span {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--pg-primary), var(--pg-secondary), var(--pg-accent));
  -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text;
}
.pg-hero-text p {
  font-size:1.05rem; color:var(--pg-muted); line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:28px; max-width:480px;
}
@media (max-width:900px) { .pg-hero-text p { margin-inline:auto; } }
.pg-hero-badge {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  background:rgba(14,165,233,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(14,165,233,0.12);
  padding:6px 16px; border-radius:100px; font-size:0.78rem; font-weight:500;
  color:rgba(14,165,233,0.8); margin-bottom:20px;
}
.pg-hero-badge i { font-size:0.55rem; color:var(--pg-secondary); }
.pg-hero-actions { display:flex; gap:12px; }
@media (max-width:900px) { .pg-hero-actions { justify-content:center; } }
.pg-btn {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
  padding:13px 32px; border-radius:12px; font-family:var(--pg-font);
  font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.3s; border:none;
}
.pg-btn-primary {
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg-primary),var(--pg-secondary));
  color:white; box-shadow:0 4px 24px rgba(14,165,233,0.35);
}
.pg-btn-primary:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(14,165,233,0.5); color:white; }
.pg-btn-outline {
  background:transparent; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
}
.pg-btn-outline:hover { border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); color:white; }

.pg-hero-visual {
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  position:relative;
}
@media (max-width:900px) { .pg-hero-visual { display:none; } }
.pg-hero-card {
  width:100%; max-width:400px;
  background:rgba(15,23,42,0.6); backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border-radius:16px; padding:24px;
}
.pg-hero-card-header { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:20px; padding-bottom:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--pg-border); }
.pg-hero-card-avatar { width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg-primary),var(--pg-accent)); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-weight:700; font-size:0.85rem; color:white; }
.pg-hero-card-info { flex:1; }
.pg-hero-card-name { font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85); }
.pg-hero-card-status { font-size:0.7rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.3); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:4px; }
.pg-hero-card-status i { font-size:0.45rem; color:var(--pg-secondary); }
.pg-hero-card-log {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:10px 0;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--pg-border);
}
.pg-hero-card-log:last-child { border-bottom:none; padding-bottom:0; }
.pg-hero-log-icon { width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:6px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:0.65rem; flex-shrink:0; }
.pg-hero-log-text { flex:1; font-size:0.78rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
.pg-hero-log-time { font-size:0.65rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.2); direction:ltr; }

.pg-section { padding:100px 28px; }
.pg-section-inner { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
.pg-label {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  padding:5px 14px; border-radius:20px; font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:600;
  margin-bottom:12px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.5px;
}
.pg-label-primary {
  background:rgba(14,165,233,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(14,165,233,0.1); color:var(--pg-primary);
}
.pg-label-secondary {
  background:rgba(139,92,246,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.1); color:var(--pg-accent);
}

.pg-features-header { text-align:center; margin-bottom:60px; }
.pg-features-header h2 { font-size:2.2rem; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:10px; }
.pg-features-header h2 span { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg-primary),var(--pg-secondary)); -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text; }
.pg-features-header p { color:var(--pg-muted); font-size:1rem; max-width:520px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.8; }
.pg-features-grid {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:24px;
}
@media (max-width:900px) { .pg-features-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); } }
@media (max-width:600px) { .pg-features-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
.pg-feature {
  padding:28px 24px; border-radius:14px;
  background:rgba(15,23,42,0.3); border:1px solid var(--pg-border);
  transition:all 0.35s ease; position:relative;
}
.pg-feature:hover {
  transform:translateY(-4px);
  border-color:rgba(14,165,233,0.15);
  background:rgba(15,23,42,0.5);
  box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
}
.pg-feature-icon {
  width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:10px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  margin-bottom:14px; font-size:1.1rem;
}
.pg-feature h3 { font-size:0.95rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:6px; }
.pg-feature p { font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--pg-muted); line-height:1.7; }
.pg-feature-tag {
  display:inline-block; margin-top:12px; font-size:0.7rem; font-weight:600;
  padding:2px 10px; border-radius:4px;
  background:rgba(14,165,233,0.06); color:var(--pg-primary);
  border:1px solid rgba(14,165,233,0.08);
}

.pg-stats-section { position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
.pg-stats-section::before {
  content:''; position:absolute; inset:0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 30% at 50% 0%, rgba(14,165,233,0.06) 0%, transparent 70%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 40% 40% at 50% 100%, rgba(139,92,246,0.04) 0%, transparent 60%);
  pointer-events:none;
}
.pg-stats-wrap {
  display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:80px; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto;
  position:relative; z-index:1;
}
@media (max-width:600px) { .pg-stats-wrap { flex-direction:column; gap:28px; align-items:center; } }
.pg-stat-item { text-align:center; position:relative; }
.pg-stat-item::after {
  content:''; position:absolute; right:-40px; top:50%; transform:translateY(-50%);
  width:1px; height:40px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
}
.pg-stat-item:last-child::after { display:none; }
@media (max-width:600px) { .pg-stat-item::after { display:none; } }
.pg-stat-icon { font-size:1.3rem; margin-bottom:6px; display:block; }
.pg-stat-number {
  font-size:2.2rem; font-weight:800; display:block;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--pg-primary),var(--pg-secondary));
  -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text;
}
.pg-stat-label { font-size:0.85rem; color:var(--pg-muted); }

.pg-cta-section { position:relative; }
.pg-cta-box {
  max-width:680px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;
  padding:56px 48px; border-radius:20px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14,165,233,0.04), rgba(139,92,246,0.04));
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}
.pg-cta-box::before {
  content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0;
  height:1px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--pg-primary), var(--pg-secondary), var(--pg-accent), transparent);
  opacity:0.5;
}
.pg-cta-box h2 { font-size:1.8rem; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:10px; }
.pg-cta-box p { color:var(--pg-muted); margin-bottom:28px; font-size:0.95rem; line-height:1.7; }
.pg-cta-box .pg-btn { margin-top:4px; }

.pg-footer {
  border-top:1px solid var(--pg-border); padding:20px 28px;
}
.pg-footer-inner {
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
  max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto;
  font-size:0.78rem; color:var(--pg-muted);
}
.pg-footer-links { display:flex; gap:16px; }
.pg-footer-links a { color:var(--pg-muted); transition:color 0.3s; }
.pg-footer-links a:hover { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

@media (max-width:768px) {
  .pg-nav { padding:0 16px; height:60px; }
  .pg-hero-content { padding:100px 16px 60px; }
  .pg-hero-text h1 { font-size:2rem; }
  .pg-hero-text p { font-size:0.9rem; }
  .pg-section { padding:60px 16px; }
  .pg-features-header h2 { font-size:1.6rem; }
  .pg-cta-box { padding:36px 20px; }
  .pg-cta-box h2 { font-size:1.3rem; }
  .pg-footer-inner { flex-direction:column; gap:8px; text-align:center; }
  .pg-stats-wrap { gap:24px; }
}

.pg-toast {
  position:fixed; bottom:24px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); z-index:9999;
  background:rgba(237,66,69,0.15); backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
  border:1px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.15);
  border-radius:10px; padding:12px 24px;
  font-size:0.85rem; color:#f87171;
  direction:rtl;
}

.lp-stat-num { display:none; }
.lp-stat-desc { display:none; }

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="pg-nav">
    <a href="/" class="pg-brand">
      <div class="pg-brand-icon"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></div>
      <span>FX9</span>
    </a>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
      <% if (locals.user) { %>
        <a href="/home" class="pg-nav-btn pg-nav-btn-primary">
          <i class="fas fa-th-large"></i>
          لوحة التحكم
        </a>
        <a href="/auth/logout" class="pg-nav-btn pg-nav-btn-danger">
          <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i>
          خروج
        </a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/auth/discord" class="pg-nav-btn pg-nav-btn-primary">
          <i class="fab fa-discord"></i>
          Login with Discord
        </a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <% if (locals.error) { %>
    <div class="pg-toast">
      <i class="fas fa-circle-exclamation"></i>
      <%= error === 'auth_failed' ? 'فشل تسجيل الدخول — تحقق من Redirect URI في Discord Developer Portal' : error === 'no_code' ? 'لم يتم استلام رمز التوثيق — حاول مرة أخرى' : error %>
    </div>
  <% } %>

  <section class="pg-hero">
    <div class="pg-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="pg-dots"></div>
    <div class="pg-hero-shape pg-hs1"></div>
    <div class="pg-hero-shape pg-hs2"></div>
    <div class="pg-hero-shape pg-hs3"></div>
    <div class="pg-hero-content">
      <div class="pg-hero-text">
        <div class="pg-hero-badge">
          <i class="fas fa-circle"></i>
          FADIX9 SYSTEM Bot v1.0.11 — البوت يعمل بكفاءة
        </div>
        <h1>حل متكامل لإدارة<br>سيرفر <span>ديسكورد</span></h1>
        <p>منصة متطورة تجمع بين الحماية، التذاكر، الأنظمة الصوتية، والإشراف — كل ما تحتاجه في لوحة واحدة سهلة الاستخدام مع مزامنة فورية</p>
        <div class="pg-hero-actions">
          <% if (locals.user) { %>
            <a href="/home" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">
              <i class="fas fa-th-large"></i>
              افتح لوحة التحكم
            </a>
            <a href="/auth/logout" class="pg-btn pg-btn-outline">
              <i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i>
              تسجيل الخروج
            </a>
          <% } else { %>
            <a href="/auth/discord" class="pg-btn pg-btn-primary">
              <i class="fab fa-discord"></i>
              ابدأ الآن — دخول ديسكورد
            </a>
            <a href="/invite-dev" class="pg-btn pg-btn-outline">
              <i class="fas fa-code-branch"></i>
              إضافة البوت لسيرفرك
            </a>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pg-hero-visual">
        <div class="pg-hero-card">
          <div class="pg-hero-card-header">
            <div class="pg-hero-card-avatar">FX</div>
            <div class="pg-hero-card-info">
              <div class="pg-hero-card-name">FX9 Bot System</div>
              <div class="pg-hero-card-status"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> متصل — 24 نشاط جديد</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pg-hero-card-log">
            <div class="pg-hero-log-icon" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,0.1);color:var(--pg-primary)"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved"></i></div>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-text">تم حظر 12 محاولة اختراق</span>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-time">منذ 2ث</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pg-hero-card-log">
            <div class="pg-hero-log-icon" style="background:rgba(20,184,166,0.1);color:var(--pg-secondary)"><i class="fas fa-ticket-alt"></i></div>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-text">تم فتح 3 تذاكر دعم</span>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-time">منذ 15ث</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pg-hero-card-log">
            <div class="pg-hero-log-icon" style="background:rgba(248,113,113,0.1);color:#f87171"><i class="fas fa-microphone"></i></div>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-text">تم إنشاء 5 غرف صوتية</span>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-time">منذ 1د</span>
          </div>
          <div class="pg-hero-card-log">
            <div class="pg-hero-log-icon" style="background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);color:var(--pg-accent)"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i></div>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-text">إشعار جديد من يوتيوب</span>
            <span class="pg-hero-log-time">منذ 3د</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="pg-section">
    <div class="pg-section-inner">
      <div class="pg-features-header">
        <div class="pg-label pg-label-primary"><i class="fas fa-cubes"></i> مزايا متكاملة</div>
        <h2>أدوات احترافية <span>لسيرفرك</span></h2>
        <p>مجموعة متكاملة من الأنظمة المصممة لتسهيل إدارة السيرفر وتحسين تجربة الأعضاء</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pg-features-grid">
        <div class="pg-feature">
          <div class="pg-feature-icon" style="background:rgba(14,165,233,0.08);color:var(--pg-primary)"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i></div>
          <h3>حماية ذكية</h3>
          <p>نظام كشف تلقائي للهجمات والروابط الضارة والمحتوى غير المرغوب فيه مع فلترة ذكية وإعدادات مرنة</p>
          <span class="pg-feature-tag">نظام آلي</span>
        </div>
        <div class="pg-feature">
